# Test: set debug module with no subsystem shows usage
# VALIDATES: CLI usage output for the verb-first debug set grammar
# the `ze debug` root command was removed (spec-cli-verb-first-followup);
# debug is now verb-first (set/delete/show/clear). The old toggle-usage assertions
# no longer apply; this asserts the new `set debug module` usage instead.
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze set debug module
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=level
expect=stderr:contains=flag
expect=stderr:contains=scope
